{"title":"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 26","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The amount <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/c/40cba44ffc429fc98e11a1605ced22243b655f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> is split into two nonnegative real numbers uniformly at random, \nfor instance, into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/d/d0d2b82692d7ea537004c2708bfe99a5332e5617.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.143$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/0/4b020f9ce8b360d270dfa4cd5c606853c33b7ee7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$.357$\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" />, or into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/7/6c77cf4b63af80bfbc6a9ad9b4b9e8e549e77d78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/7/87756767f2186a43416b1bd8f2064bcd54e6fb41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.5-\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" />. \nThen each number is rounded to its nearest integer, for instance, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the first case above, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the second. What is the probability that the two integers sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/3/ae3e985d1d0f5c3a0676a924df1cb2f2fc511cca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{4} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{2}{5} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{2} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{3}{5}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"371\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The two parts may round to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />; or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. By considering the possible ranges for each case, it is easy to see that each case is equally likely (they divide the interval from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/c/40cba44ffc429fc98e11a1605ced22243b655f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" />, in which one of the parts is found, into five equal ranges of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/2/192b4a258ee998961a99523fd0f0a029f9ea194a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.5$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/2/192b4a258ee998961a99523fd0f0a029f9ea194a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.5$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/7/15788e198a53ced87268aea78fcde68a84de92c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/7/15788e198a53ced87268aea78fcde68a84de92c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/c/40cba44ffc429fc98e11a1605ced22243b655f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" />). As exactly two of the five cases give a sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/d/9bdcc9ee7482c144aff5368c1b69d2e15c2d65ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/2/ca2297526ede0e6c616802ca72adf69c82518f25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />, which is answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e33ab9a00e021af49e888212645d4667903c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME\" title=\"1987 AHSME\">1987 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"